    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0004",
      "reading_order": 44,
      "section": "About safety messages",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.29421997070312,
        "t": 617.4985809326172,
        "r": 558.7847900390625,
        "b": 362.24517822265625
      },
      "markdown": "| Hazard level   | Indication                                                                                                                        |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| DANGER:        | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, will result in death or serious injury                                               |\n| WARNING:       | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, could result in death or serious injury                                              |\n| CAUTION:       | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, could result in minor or moderate injury                                             |\n| NOTICE:        | • A potential situation which, if not avoided, could result in undesirable conditions • A practice not related to personal injury |"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0034",
      "reading_order": 45,
      "section": "About safety messages",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 338.13545999999997,
        "r": 541.6200000000003,
        "b": 314.89545999999996
      },
      "content": "Hazard categories can either fall under hazard levels or let specific symbols replace the ordinary hazard level symbols."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0035",
      "reading_order": 46,
      "section": "About safety messages",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 311.13545999999997,
        "r": 393.3100000000002,
        "b": 299.89545999999996
      },
      "content": "Electrical hazards are indicated by the following specific symbol:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0036",
      "reading_order": 47,
      "section": "Electrical Hazard:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 286.13545999999997,
        "r": 223.98999999999998,
        "b": 274.89545999999996
      },
      "content": "Electrical Hazard:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0037",
      "reading_order": 48,
      "section": "Electrical Hazard:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 231.47996999999998,
        "r": 553.6700000000003,
        "b": 208.23996999999997
      },
      "content": "These are examples of other categories that can occur. They fall under the ordinary hazard levels and may use complementing symbols:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0038",
      "reading_order": 49,
      "section": "Electrical Hazard:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.0,
